OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA warm and sunny start, but
OL,6,Fcloud tending to increase throughout
OL,7,Fthe day making the sunshine hazy. A
OL,8,Ffew showers also possibly developing
OL,9,Fcome the afternoon. Feeling a little
OL,10,Fcooler.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,13,Fdry throughout the weekend with a mix
OL,14,Fof cloud and sunshine. Dry initially
OL,15,FMonday but rain may move in later.
OL,16,FFeeling cooler as temperatures return
OL,17,Fto nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
